@startuml DD-01-local
title DD-01 - Topology local theo compose.yaml (7feda73)\nCau hinh hien co; chua phai minh chung full-stack runtime
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50

node "May nguoi dung" as Host {
  node "Trinh duyet" as Browser
  node "Docker / brewlite-network" as Network {
    node "frontend :3000\nNext.js runtime" as Web
    node "backend :3001\nNestJS runtime" as Api {
      component "MockGatewayService\nnoi bo process" as Gateway
    }
    node "migrate\nOne-shot npm run prisma:deploy" as Migrate
    database "postgres :5432\nPostgreSQL 18" as Db
    storage "postgres-data\n/var/lib/postgresql" as Volume
  }
}
Browser --> Web : HTTP localhost:WEB_PORT (3000)
Browser --> Api : HTTP localhost:API_PORT (3001)/api/v1
Web ..> Api : API_INTERNAL_URL (cau hinh SSR)
Api --> Db : Prisma / SQL; DATABASE_URL
Migrate --> Db : Prisma migrations
Db --> Volume : persistent data

note bottom of Network
  Thu tu: DB healthy -> migrate exit 0 -> backend healthy -> frontend.
  Health frontend: GET /; backend: GET /api/v1/health; DB: pg_isready.
  Port PostgreSQL publish ra host theo POSTGRES_PORT (mac dinh 5432).
  Migration khong tu seed catalog. Mock gateway khong la service Docker rieng.
  NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL la URL browser, duoc truyen luc build frontend.
end note
@enduml
